   "does": "Builds the HR series sorted by wall-clock offset: per-beat HR from the RR series via WorkoutAnalyzer.hrSamplesWithWallClock (gap-corrected wall-clock offsets) when the session has beats; else positive-HR WorkoutSamples, each moved from its pause-excluded offsetSec onto the wall clock with WorkoutMetadata.wallClockSeconds(forActiveOffset:), so they line up with trackpoint times after a pause.",
